Subject: Fil-C yolomusl adaptations on top of upstream musl 1.2.4
Upstream-Base: musl f314e133929b6379eccc632bef32eaebb66a7335 (v1.2.4+)
Fil-C-Head: e7b7f1e8969e24411b3d588bb9a043e5676f854d (branch deluge)

Mechanically extracted diff between upstream musl commit
f314e133929b6379eccc632bef32eaebb66a7335 and projects/yolomusl at Fil-C
e7b7f1e8969e24411b3d588bb9a043e5676f854d. Builds the un-pizlonated
underlying libc (libyoloc.so, libyoloc.a, ld-fil1-<arch>.so, CRT objects)
used beneath libpizlo.

Fil-C-Origin-Commits (6):
  a8c295674428f4a83f7fc06a9dd2fe85defab6de 2026-10-15 Add support for statmount and listmount. Also make sure we expose open_tree, move_mount, fsopen, fsconfig, fsmount, fspick, mount_setattr, statmount, and listmount via syscall(2).
  46468cce242e31916ce3ea81598a57234d43d3dc 2026-08-08 Pass -fPIE when building objects for libyolomusl.a
  b9dd49b0fd22894f255f8e32fe39075ca24e0eb9 2026-07-19 Switch to builtins for atomic ops in yolomusl
  39ee664dbf0b7db841ae05269201e757447290ee 2026-03-27 Make it possible to build libpas with g++, but don't make that the default. It's annoying for bootstrapping that libpas requires clang to build. Libpas cannot build with gcc because it uses initializer expressions that gcc thinks are non-constant, but g++ accepts them just fine. So, this change makes libpas's code build in C++ (which was a goal of libpas all along). Sadly, building with g++ results in a 1.2% slow-down on PizBench9019. Hence, this leaves clang as the default for building libpas. But it's possible that newer versions of g++ will fare better, so it's good that we have this option. Super weirdly, there were two casts in filc_runtime.h that C++ requires and that pessimize codegen in clang - so I am guarding those with ifdef's. I don't think that'll be necessary if Fil-C starts bootstrapping on newer compilers.
  ffa237d3cd9429778ded0b788a9591c1080df5b7 2025-08-08 Fil-C changes to yolomusl since f314e133929b6379eccc632bef32eaebb66a7335
  d26b9ecdcee0bb03d497bb7c415aaa03ef95b528 2025-08-08 Initial commit of yolomusl at f314e133929b6379eccc632bef32eaebb66a7335

